<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">30062026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>In Venezuela, families in La Guaira are digging through the rubble of the Bello Horizonte towers with their bare hands.</s> <s>Firefighters arrived forty-eight hours after the earthquake, and police stood at the site without joining the rescue.</s> <s>Hundreds of bodies may stay buried for good... and a grieving public is now asking who was supposed to come, and didn't.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A shooting in Herat passed this week without a word of international rebuke.</s> <s>Five years after returning to power, the Taliban face less isolation than at any point since two thousand twenty-one, even as repression inside Afghanistan continues unchanged.</s> <s>No state has formally recognized their government, yet sanctions are easing while the conduct that once justified that isolation goes on.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Peru's electoral authority has declared Keiko Fujimori president, with fifty point one four percent on her fourth attempt at the office.</s> <s>The daughter of the jailed strongman Alberto Fujimori takes control of South America's top copper exporter after a recount of disputed ballots.</s> <s>Her Popular Force party controls Congress, and a deeply divided electorate now waits to see how she'll use that power.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>An Israeli drone killed three Palestinians in Deir al-Balah, among them eight-year-old Malik Abu Shaweesh, the Al-Aqsa Hospital said.</s> <s>Since October's ceasefire, Gaza's media office counts one thousand forty-five Palestinians killed and more than three thousand documented violations.</s> <s>A ceasefire that still produces daily funerals is a ceasefire in name alone.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Russian missiles struck the Ukrainian city of Dnipro, killing six people and wounding twenty-nine, the regional governor said.</s> <s>Kharkiv and Zaporizhzhia were hit too, bringing the day's toll to ten across a war now in its fifth year.</s> <s>President Zelensky urged Europe to build its own missile defenses, knowing American support may not hold.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>India's National Stock Exchange and Jio Platforms plan to raise seven point three billion dollars between them.</s> <s>The exchange is valued at around fifty-seven billion and Jio at as much as one hundred sixty billion, ranking these among the largest share sales India has ever seen.</s> <s>Both read a single truth — a phone-glued population has become the foundation of the country's deepening capital markets.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistan's Federal Investigation Agency has charged executives of GO Petroleum, alleging thirty-two thousand tonnes of fuel vanished from a bonded depot.</s> <s>Bonded petroleum must clear customs before sale, and the agency says the company sold non-duty-paid fuel without ever filing the declarations.</s> <s>For a treasury starved of foreign currency, billions in evaded levy is money the state can ill afford to lose.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The European Union has shut Binance out of its market.</s> <s>Europe's new Markets in Crypto-Assets law requires a national license to operate across the bloc — Coinbase and OKX qualified, and Binance, which claims three hundred million users, did not.</s> <s>Europe is the first major bloc to make crypto access depend on state authorization, a template others are likely to copy.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A twenty-five-year private prison concession in Bloemfontein expires this week, and South Africa is defying a court order on transferring its guards.</s> <s>Labour law there requires that staff move automatically when a privatized prison returns to state control.</s> <s>The Popcru union is now threatening contempt charges, and the handover of Mangaung prison hangs in the balance.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Across Africa, cryptococcal meningitis is killing people with advanced HIV — not for lack of a cure, but for lack of a test.</s> <s>The antifungal treatment exists, yet diagnostic kits are scarce in exactly the under-resourced systems where the infection is most common.</s> <s>Global health funding chases headline diseases, doctors say, while a cheap diagnostic gap quietly takes lives.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>For the first time, clean power was the world's largest source of new energy in twenty twenty-five.</s> <s>Wind and solar grew more than eighteen percent and met all of the year's new electricity demand, the Energy Institute found, though coal also set a record and fossil fuels still supply eighty-six percent of primary energy.</s> <s>The milestone is real, but the world is adding clean power on top of fossil fuels, not yet in their place.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers at Finland's University of Turku have built the first reliable laboratory model of a melanoma that defeats every immunotherapy.</s> <s>The cancer, driven by a missing gene called BAP1, resists all treatment once it spreads, and without a model new therapies could never be tested.</s> <s>Scientists can now probe why these tumors evade the immune system, a first step toward reaching patients who have none.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Slow earthquakes silently load stress onto locked faults before the great ruptures arrive.</s> <s>Researchers at Australia's University of New England have found the trigger is pore-fluid pressure, not the shape of the fault itself.</s> <s>Published in the journal Geology, the finding hands seismologists a new variable for forecasting the hazard along the world's subduction zones.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Mullvad, the privacy VPN trusted for its no-logs promise, has a chief executive revealed as the main financier of a Swedish political party.</s> <s>The company markets itself on the personal trustworthiness of the people who run it, yet its public documentation discloses none of their political ties.</s> <s>Privacy tools are only as trustworthy as their operators, and users are left to wonder how much they can really know.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Fraud networks driven out of Southeast Asia's crackdowns are now scouting the Pacific Islands for new bases.</s> <s>Fresh subsea cables and Starlink have wired up island states that long lacked reliable internet, and the same bandwidth built for development is drawing the scammers.</s> <s>The Lowy Institute warns these small states lack the laws and policing to keep pace — connectivity and crime arriving together.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>America's Supreme Court has ruled, six to three, that police need a warrant for phone location data.</s> <s>So-called geofence warrants sweep up every phone near a crime scene, and the court held that opting into Google's location tracking does not surrender Fourth Amendment rights.</s> <s>The case now returns to a lower court to test whether one such search can stand.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>